<title>UK: L-Bank sets 250 million mark May 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>L-Bank sets 250 million mark May 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Nikko Europe.</p>
<p> BORROWER   L-BANK</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN MARK  COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    21.MAY.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.92     PAY DATE    28.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  22.5 BP   REOFFER    99.92     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 100     SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 1</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> NOTES	TOKAI BANK IS JOINT LEAD MANAGER</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
